# The table-driven stage-2 candidate as emitted and committed: opcodes and call targets.
# Regenerate with probes/install/ir/capture-stage2-dfa.sh.
#
# The derivation, measured at three points, in this order:
#   the fused emission of the same source at the same flags: 1249 lines / 158 blocks,
#     carrying binary64 (the always_inline number path);
#   the same source with the included unit's helpers noinline: 566 lines / 92 blocks, no
#     binary64 and no vector operation -- this is the point that makes "the FP is
#     semantic, not surface" a measurement;
#   the fixture below, with the staging objects flattened to parameters: 564 lines,
#     379 instruction(s), 92 block(s), 19 phi(s), 2 alloca(s), 1 `ret`.
#
# The body is the switch-lowered form: 6 `switch` became comparison chains.
#
